    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/8bb2bca6d1c0262ec4875e61a92c4601.avif?t=1744302214\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone strange has entered your office. They offer you historical objects which can fulfil your darkest desires. However, you must answer their questions first. Three wrong answers and it can cost you more than you bargained for. Do you accept?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect the objects and make deductions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/bb6e872c759d72f754bdcc533a5667fd.poster.avif?t=1744302214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/bb6e872c759d72f754bdcc533a5667fd.webm?t=1744302214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/bb6e872c759d72f754bdcc533a5667fd.mp4?t=1744302214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search your archaeology handbook</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/c2d3a6f8089675d3ab201207eaee4331.poster.avif?t=1744302214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/c2d3a6f8089675d3ab201207eaee4331.webm?t=1744302214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/c2d3a6f8089675d3ab201207eaee4331.mp4?t=1744302214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the history behind the objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/e42618ef872108ad480a8bfddfc78a25.avif?t=1744302214\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your answers on cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/a44e5835dcf7a68e26fdb7b29c6f8387.poster.avif?t=1744302214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/a44e5835dcf7a68e26fdb7b29c6f8387.webm?t=1744302214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/a44e5835dcf7a68e26fdb7b29c6f8387.mp4?t=1744302214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reply carefully<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/9d0f14e30e73528aba37f8fe4f87ca5e.poster.avif?t=1744302214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/9d0f14e30e73528aba37f8fe4f87ca5e.webm?t=1744302214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446860/extras/9d0f14e30e73528aba37f8fe4f87ca5e.mp4?t=1744302214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your answers decide your fate.</h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta